   "titulo": "Greeting with education",
   "texto": [
    "**Γεια σου** is informal; **Γεια σας** serves to greet several people or to address one person with courtesy. **Καλημέρα** is used in the morning; **Καλησπέρα** in the afternoon and at dusk.",
    "To say goodbye you can say **Αντίο**. **Παρακαλώ** means «Please.» and is also used when responding to «Thank you.»."
